    "title": "Tactacam REVEAL",
    "description": "Unlock the power and clarity of remote cellular transmission through the Tactacam REVEAL mobile app. Experience complete mastery over your REVEAL cellular cameras by viewing galleries, sharing feeds, adjusting settings, and reviewing critical stats, all from the comfort of your home. With the Tactacam REVEAL mobile app, release the power of your REVEAL and keep watch over the outdoors.\r\n\r\nHow to Connect:\r\n1. Download the REVEAL app and create your account\r\n2. Follow screen prompts to set up a data plan\r\n3. Scan your REVEAL camera QR code to activate and connect\r\n4. Place your REVEAL camera in its monitoring location\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Effortless setup and activation\r\n- Manage multiple cameras remotely\r\n- Convenient visibility of billing history\r\n- View and organize photo and video galleries\r\n- Monitor camera health and stats\r\n- Share and receive photo feeds with others\r\n- Available on-demand photo capture",
